<translation id="3405035915691517126">Luxxle imeshindwa kukagua manenosiri yako. Jaribu tena baada ya saa 24.</translation>
<translation id="5755581833598928580">Tumia Luxxle wakati wowote unabofya viungo kwenye ujumbe, hati na programu nyinginezo</translation>
